{"id":1993,"name":"Mushishi","slug":"mushishi","synopsis":"They are neither plants nor animals. They differ from other forms of life such as the micro-organisms and the fungi. Instead they resemble the primeval body of life and are generally known as \"Mushi\". Their existence and appearance are unknown to many and only a limited number of humans are aware of them. Ginko is a \"Mushi-shi\" who travels around to investigate and find out more about the \"Mushi\". In the process, he also lends a helping hand to people who face problems with supernatural occurances which may be related to the \"Mushi\".\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)","format":"TV","season":"FALL","year":2005,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:44:18","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 05:40:54","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":457},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":457},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":419},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":3433},{"site":"ANN","externalId":5923},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":1053},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"HULU","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":3977,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/jmI3gOICLozcfkKA0Hsp0eIJq3ulFoyweCdrrV69.png"},{"id":3978,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/uCp2u2iB8glJxhIJ5CSjRij2vBhDJAEzthQXjadr.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":136,"name":"Artland","slug":"artland"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":626,"name":"Mushishi","slug":"mushishi"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":2093,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":2093,"title":"The Sore Feet Song","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":2336,"version":1,"episodes":"1-17, 19-23, 25","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":1064,"basename":"Mushishi-OP1-NCBD1080.webm","filename":"Mushishi-OP1-NCBD1080","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/Mushishi-OP1-NCBD1080.webm","mimetype":"video/webm","size":47771755,"resolution":1080,"nc":true,"subbed":false,"lyrics":false,"overlap":"NONE","source":